  "profile": {
    "overview": "The Boros Legion is the militant fist of Ravnican justice, serving as both a police force and a standing army.",
    "philosophy": "Justice must be defended in public. Boros philosophy merges white structural order with red moral conviction, creating a peacekeeping ideal where immediate action is favored over procedural delay.",
    "core_tension": "The 'Wojek vs. Army' dynamic: Balancing the pragmatic, street-level investigation of the officer with the unyielding, high-altitude zeal of the military commander.",
    "social_or_institutional_role": "As the primary peacekeeping force, the Legion manages everything from local neighborhood patrols (League of Wojek) to planetary defense (Boros Army).",
    "mechanics_and_play_pattern": "Mechanics like Battalion and Mentor emphasize unit cohesion; individuals are strengthened by the presence of their allies on the field.",
